  "description": "Breaking through the hellish realm of salt, I slash the heavens of the reversed world with my sword! My spirit flows exhilaratingly through the autumn of a thousand years! Will you follow your past self? I will give you the world! Will you forget your past self? I will gain the most beautiful woman in the world! The only fire and sulfur dragon, Yongcheonsan, who fights the immortal demons that cover the heavens and earth!\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
